  "description": "Synchronises multi-rate sensor streams (e.g. a 100 Hz load cell, a 10 Hz thermocouple and a 1 Hz pressure transmitter) on a common high-resolution time base and logs them to CSV and SQLite without blocking the acquisition threads. Raw and time-aligned (last known value or linear interpolation) modes, buffered batch writing, graceful shutdown and live status.",
